== Ebook Sources

The full ebook source set, reached through the centred block wrapper. This is the taken branch when the
edition is the ebook, and its heading and paragraph are the only source content that should reach the
rendered page.

This second paragraph gives the ebook branch enough body text to wrap across more than one line, so a
regression that dropped or duplicated it moves the page count rather than a number that quietly stops
being read.
